    "sub_name": "策略分析與競爭優勢",
    "sub_ename": "STRATEGY ANALYSIS AND COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGE",
    "describe_ch": "策略分析教授學生策略決策的概念、架構與技巧，本門課的目標是協助EMBA學生了解如何在快速發展的管理領域找到公司競爭優勢的來源，課程會著重在策略的基本任務，建立與實施可以善用競爭優勢的策略。",
    "describe_eh": "Strategy analysis equips students with the concept, framework and techniques needed to make better strategic decisions. The goal aims to help EMBA students understand how to identify the sources of superior business performance in fast-developing field of management. The course’s focus on the essential tasks of strategy, by formulating and implementing a strategy that exploits these sources of superior performance.",
